  "body": "CCC & Titles issued!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 32 Tyrian Close, Half Moon Bay — a boutique collection of four brand-new freehold standalone residences, perfectly positioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac. Combining contemporary design, quality craftsmanship, and an enviable coastal lifestyle, these homes offer the ideal balance of comfort, privacy, and convenience.\r\n\r\nEnjoy elevated sea views across the Hauraki Gulf or picturesque outlooks towards Pigeon Mountain, all while being just moments from beaches, Half Moon Bay Marina, cafes, restaurants, shops, and the ferry terminal for easy access to Auckland CBD and Waiheke Island.\r\n\r\nZoned for highly regarded local schools including Pigeon Mountain Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate, and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nAvailable Homes\r\nLot 1 – 3 Bedrooms + Study | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | 132m² Floor Area\r\nLot 2 – 3 Bedrooms + Study | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | 140m² Floor Area\r\nLot 3 – 3 Bedrooms + Study | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | 137m² Floor Area\r\nLot 4 – 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage | 148m² Floor Area - Sold\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n• Four brand-new freehold standalone homes\r\n• Elevated sea views or Pigeon Mountain outlooks\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Quiet and family-friendly cul-de-sac setting\r\n• Premium school zoning\r\n• Minutes to the marina, beaches, cafes, shops, and ferry services\r\n• Low-maintenance lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nMove in, relax, and enjoy the very best of Half Moon Bay living. Contact us today to secure your preferred residence.",
